COMMANDER FARRAGUT FELT AND WITH GOOD REASON THAT IT WAS BEST TO STAY IN DEEP WATERS AND KEEP HIS DISTANCE FROM CONTINENTS OR ISLANDS NO DOUBT OUR BOSUN SAID BECAUSE THERE ISNT ENOUGH WATER FOR HIM
